WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.132
With Smartling, resource files
go through a translation job

2
00:00:04.132 --> 00:00:05.675
and return through a connector.

3
00:00:06.150 --> 00:00:07.822
Smartling does this well,

4
00:00:07.822 --> 00:00:10.805
with AI and human
translation from one vendor.

5
00:00:11.650 --> 00:00:14.878
General Translation generates
app translations from your code

6
00:00:14.878 --> 00:00:16.467
as part of each release.

7
00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:20.402
Keep the copy readable
inside a T component,

8
00:00:20.402 --> 00:00:21.736
with a note for intent.

9
00:00:22.150 --> 00:00:25.424
Put npx gt translate
before the app build,

10
00:00:25.424 --> 00:00:26.979
so French ships with it.

11
00:00:27.650 --> 00:00:31.586
Or configure Locadex to open
translation pull requests from

12
00:00:31.586 --> 00:00:32.757
repository events.

13
00:00:33.150 --> 00:00:35.808
Your team now ships
French with each release.
